          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Harry and Marv, the bumbling \"Wet Bandits,\" have paid their debt to society and are now ready to get revenge on the youngster that caused them their humiliating defeat Kevin McCallister. They have arranged for Kevin's family to be out of the house when they come calling again, leaving him home alone for their rematch. This time, the sneaky thieves have beefed up their gang with robbers and crooks that are more than eager to help themselves to the McCallister valuables. Only the resourceful Kevin stands between the new Wet Bandit gang and his family's fortune.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Harry y Marv, los torpes «Wet Bandits», ya han pagado su deuda con la sociedad y ahora están listos para vengarse del jovencito que les causó su humillante derrota: Kevin McCallister. Han organizado que la familia de Kevin esté fuera de casa cuando vuelvan a presentarse, dejándolo solo para su revancha. Esta vez, los ladrones astutos han reforzado su banda con asaltantes y criminales que están más que dispuestos a quedarse con los objetos de valor de los McCallister. Solo el ingenioso Kevin se interpone entre la nueva banda de Wet Bandits y la fortuna de su familia.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1991",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
